.TH vdir 1 (date) "GNU coreutils (unreleased)"
.SH NAME
vdir \- list directory contents
.SH Synopsis
.SY vdir
.RI [ OPTION \~.\|.\|.\&]
.RI [ FILE \~.\|.\|.\&]
.YS
.SH Description
.B vdir
is equivalent to
.IR ls\~\-l\~\-b .
.P
See
.BR ls (1).
